# Package selection for the x86_64 EFI build.
# Derived from the official iStoreOS 25.12 x86-64 manifest
# (fw.koolcenter.com/iStoreOS/ib/x86_64/istoreos-x86-64-generic.manifest),
# trimmed to package names. scripts/build_istoreos.py turns each line
# into a CONFIG_PACKAGE_<name>=y entry appended to the seed.
#
# A few names are virtual/meta packages; 'make defconfig' silently drops
# any symbol it cannot resolve, which is expected here.

